  "level:42": {
   "type": "doc",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Seven perks across the stretch: Acrobatics, Athletics rank 2, Combat Reflexes, then Nimble Fingers, Cutpurse and Poisoner in Finesse, and Sniper. The glass helmet, gauntlets and boots finish the set.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Keep raising Smithing. Elven Smithing at 43 needs it at 50.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  "level:43": {
   "type": "doc",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Elven Smithing comes from the book About Elven Craftsmanship, so the perk point goes to Night Vision. Glass Smithing at 50 needs Smithing 70.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  "level:44": {
