     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Five perks across the stretch: Immunization, Cloak and Dagger, Salt on the Wound, Problem Solver and Tripwire. Glass Smithing comes from the book An Introduction to Malachite once Smithing reaches 70; use it on the glass set.",
